        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="20" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">residents Association 10 flats are we suitbale for free bussiness banking</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">I thought that the £8 monthly account fee was being removed as per your email of 24/06/ 2025 . Why am I still being charged £8 per month ?</sample>
