        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">i got a message saying £5 charge would no longer be applied to our account but it still is</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">stop cheque charge</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">hi did I read something saying you were stopping the monthly business account charge of £8 ? when does this take effect</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">I thought I was told I would no longer be charged a monthly account fee as a small business customer . When will this charge stop ?</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">I received an email saying that no more monthly charges will be applied but I am still charged for some reason . Can you fix this ?</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">I received an email saying that the monthly charge was being removed . However I’m still seeing it on my statements .</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">Hello , on 25th June I received a notification that the £8 monthly account would cease from 1st July. This has not been ceased , can you please advise</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">what are my banking charges</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">On 25 / 0625 you sent me a letter stating that you stop my service charges £8.00 pm yo are still charging us</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">why is our business account being charged £5 a month ?</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">monthly charges still being taken</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">I thought my monthly account charge was no longer ?</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">monthly account fee still being charged</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">We received an email letting us know that we would no longer be charged a monthly account fee . The email was sent on the 24th June * 025 . Since this date we have been charged £8.00 in July and August . Please can you let me know if these charges were made in erroe ]</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">Hi , I received an email from you on 26/06/2025 telling me that my £8 banking charged would be discontinued from July . You said this was automatic and I didn’t need to do anything . However , you have continued to that the £8 fee in July and August this year . Can you advise please ? Thanks Chris</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="20" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">Hi , can i deposit cash for free if my account is new ?</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="20" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">You offer HSBC customers 90 % discount but we can't seem to use it</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">I received an email on the 24th June that said you were removing the £8 charge from my business account but it has been charged on 21st July and the 21st August. Was this email a scam ?</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">free business banking</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="10" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">hello , what free of charge accounting platform are you providing with fir all your clients ?</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">Hi , I am planning to shortly make my business dormant . Is it possible to freeze the account until the business recommences operation ? Or will I have to close it and reopen a new account ? I don’t want to keep paying a monthly fee when the business isn’t trading</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">Why have I been charged 15</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">Hi , We've recived email 2 month ago about removing 5 GBP monthly fees as a commetment from your side to support our charitable organization .</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">free banking period ?</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">hi , can you advise why I have not been charged the monthly £8 account fee ?</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">Hi , can you help please . . We have received an email 25th June * 025 notifying us about £8 account charges will stop from 1st July * 025 , and I see that hasn't happened . Please can you explain and advise</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">Why are you still charging the £5 fee for this account ? You sent me a letter in the post to say that you won’t be charging this account anymore as it is a charitable bank account</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">Hi i am enquiring about the bank charges . I thought they were being remover according to email i recived .</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">Why am I still being charged £8 per month ? I thought HSBC Buisness accounts were now free free .</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">hello , I had a letter to says you will not charge account fees anymore , why r u still charging me</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">i notice from our bank statement that you are charging us a £5 monthly service charge ! Why ? The documents we received when opening the account that no servive charge would be levied !</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">I thought thye $35.00 monthly charge was stopping on my registered charity account , but it is still being deducted monthly</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">I recently got charged £129.50 for bank fees can you give me a breakdown of what these fees were</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">i'm still being charged for the account fee of £8</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">I was told that no more mo they charges from 1st July but still being charged . Pls advise</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">Please can you tell me why I’m still being charged a monthly bank charge of £8.00 on my account when I received a letter saying this would stop in July 2025 ? Thanks .</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">How do I print bank charge statements</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">We had an email saying that account charges would cease from 1st July but we are still being charged</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="20" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">Hi , i have recently opened a business banking account . I hve rasd through terms and conditions but wanted to make sure that there are charher for having this account as i thiught it was free ? Just want to double check</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">why have i been charged £32 a month for</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">BANK CHARGE INVOICE</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">Hi I thought I’d received a letter saying the £5 banking charge would be stopping ? We’re still getting charged tho ?</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">On 25 June you wrote to me saying that you were removing my £8 monthly account fee . On 12 August , you charged me £8.50 . What's going on ?</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">Yes , I know that is free now , but is it changing in Dec * 025 ?</sample>
        <sample intentref="enquire-charge" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">changes to bank fee</sample>
