        <sample intentref="enquire-safeguarding" count="1" excluded="false" fullyVerified="true">You have sent me the below text We've recently written to you to ask you to call us . We'd like to help you use the online Customer Information Review to send us up-to-date information about you and your business . Unfortunately , we still haven't heard from you . Please contact us using Live Chat or look up HSBC Business Safeguard for more ways to get in touch . Your financial security is important to us so we'll never send you a link to update your details . Can I update these in the app ?</sample>
